A '''Harpy''' is a [[Mythological Creature]] that can be spawned from [[Griffin Burrows]] during the [[Mythological Ritual]].

== Spawning ==
A '''Harpy''' can be spawned by digging up [[Griffin Burrows]] with a {{Rare}} or higher {{Item|Griffin Pet}} equipped.

