== Behavior ==
A '''Harpy''' jumps into the air and slowly falls down. While airborne, it shoots arrows at the player. If the player is hit by an arrow, their maximum {{Stat|Int}} and {{Stat|Vitality}} is reduced, by no more than -50%, until the '''Harpy''' is defeated. Once the '''Harpy''' reaches {{Stat|HP|50%}}, it stops jumping.

